  "releaseNotes": "1.0\n- Initial release.\n- Added ValidationBehavior: how much a validator reports, along two axes — across its properties\n  (ValidationBehaviors.Class) and within one property's rule chain (ValidationBehaviors.Property).\n  Configurable on the registration, on a validator, and per chain with WithValidationBehavior.\n  Replaces ContinueOnFailure(), which is equivalent to WithValidationBehavior(ValidationBehavior.All).\n  The defaults are unchanged behaviour: every property, one message each.",
